meta {
  name: List Stored Prices
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/market-integrations/prices
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  source: viwanda
  commodity: 
  market: 
  search: 
  ordering: -price_date
  page: 1
  page_size: 10
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

docs {
  Lists standardized stored prices from commodities_prices.

  Path params:
  - None

  Query params:
  - source: optional source key. Use viwanda to show standardized Viwanda prices.
  - commodity: optional commodity filter.
  - market: optional exact market filter.
  - search: optional search across source, market, commodity, price type, and currency.
  - ordering: optional sort. Supported fields include source, market, commodity, price, price_date, created_at, raw_prices_count. Prefix with - for descending.
  - page: page number.
  - page_size: records per page, capped by API.

  Auth:
  - Bearer token with market integration permission.

  Notes:
  - These are the normalized prices used by the main market price system.
  - Raw records can point here through raw_commodity_prices.normalized_price_id.
}
